<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quā^drŭplex</span></b> ,
			ĭcis, adj.
		quattuor-plico. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Fourfold</i>, <i>quadruple</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecunia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc. 5, 2, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ordo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					30, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quadruplici radice,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					27, 8, 38, § 60</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b>, in gen., <i>four</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stellae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Arat. 92</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quā^drŭplex</span></b> ,
			ĭcis, n., <i>a
				fourfold amount</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gubernatoribus duplex, magistris quadruplex
					dedit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					45, 42, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
